    {
      "name": "Expenses",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Search Expenses",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/expenses?date_from=2026-08-01&date_to=2026-08-31&page=1&size=20",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["expenses"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "date_from", "value": "2026-08-01" },
                { "key": "date_to", "value": "2026-08-31" },
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "size", "value": "20" },
                { "key": "group_id", "value": "{{personal_group_id}}", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "category", "value": "groceries", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "payment_method_id", "value": "{{payment_method_id}}", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "currency", "value": "ARS", "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Sin group_id, filtra implícitamente por todos los grupos donde sos miembro (regla 226 de la guideline). Respuesta minificada (id/date/amount/currency/description/category/group_id) — para el objeto completo con splits usá 'Get Expense by ID'."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Expense (Personal, sin split)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('expense_id', body.id);",
                  "}",
                  "if (body.created_by_user_id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('user_id', body.created_by_user_id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"date\": \"2026-08-20\",\n  \"amount\": 150000,\n  \"currency\": \"ARS\",\n  \"description\": \"Supermercado\",\n  \"category\": \"groceries\",\n  \"group_id\": \"{{personal_group_id}}\",\n  \"payment_method_id\": \"{{payment_method_id}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/expenses",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["expenses"]
            },
            "description": "Grupo Personal -> no requiere split_strategy. amount va en centavos (150000 = $1500.00). Auto-completa `expense_id` y `user_id`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Expense (Shared, split EQUAL)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"date\": \"2026-08-20\",\n  \"amount\": 9000,\n  \"currency\": \"ARS\",\n  \"description\": \"Alquiler\",\n  \"category\": \"rent\",\n  \"group_id\": \"{{shared_group_id}}\",\n  \"payment_method_id\": \"{{payment_method_id}}\",\n  \"split_strategy\": \"EQUAL\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/expenses",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["expenses"]
            },
            "description": "Grupo no-Personal -> requiere split_strategy. EQUAL reparte entre TODOS los miembros actuales del grupo (con `shared_group_id` recién creado, sos el único miembro, así que el split completo cae en `user_id`)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Expense (Shared, split PERCENTAGE)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"date\": \"2026-08-20\",\n  \"amount\": 10000,\n  \"currency\": \"ARS\",\n  \"description\": \"Internet\",\n  \"category\": \"utilities\",\n  \"group_id\": \"{{shared_group_id}}\",\n  \"payment_method_id\": \"{{payment_method_id}}\",\n  \"split_strategy\": \"PERCENTAGE\",\n  \"split_members\": [\n    { \"user_id\": \"{{user_id}}\", \"percentage\": 50 },\n    { \"user_id\": \"{{roommate_user_id}}\", \"percentage\": 50 }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/expenses",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["expenses"]
            },
            "description": "Los porcentajes deben sumar 100. Requiere que `roommate_user_id` sea miembro real de `shared_group_id` (ver nota sobre invitaciones en la descripción de la colección)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Expense (Shared, split ROMANA)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"date\": \"2026-08-20\",\n  \"amount\": 10000,\n  \"currency\": \"ARS\",\n  \"description\": \"Compra proporcional al ingreso\",\n  \"category\": \"groceries\",\n  \"group_id\": \"{{shared_group_id}}\",\n  \"payment_method_id\": \"{{payment_method_id}}\",\n  \"split_strategy\": \"ROMANA\",\n  \"split_members\": [\n    { \"user_id\": \"{{user_id}}\", \"amount\": 6000 },\n    { \"user_id\": \"{{roommate_user_id}}\", \"amount\": 4000 }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/expenses",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["expenses"]
            },
            "description": "Para ROMANA el cliente manda los montos ya calculados (no hay campo de 'ingreso' en el modelo) — deben sumar exactamente `amount`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Find Expense by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/expenses/{{expense_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["expenses", "{{expense_id}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
